  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rainforest protection through indigenous-led governance and stewardship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the official recognition of Indigenous Local Governments (ILGs) and improved conditions for an inclusive and culturally-relevant governance of indigenous territories in the Colombian Amazon. The project also seeks to increase the participation of women in the implementation of indigenous councils, contributing to gender equality in governance processes.</narrative>
  </description>
